    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d850">

                <pb facs="0724" n="712" sameAs="frus:frus1940v05/pg712"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.51/2537</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Braden</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 939</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-08-20">August 20, 1940</date>.<lb/>[Received August
                        30.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to refer to my despatch
                    No. 877 of July 26, 1940, transmitting the original Spanish text and English
                    translation <pb facs="0725" n="713" xml:id="pg713"/> of Decree 1388 of 1940
                    authorizing the settlement of the Colombian Government’s dollar bonded
                    indebtedness.</p>
                <p>On July 18, 1940, there was issued under the President’s special powers as
                    conferred by Law 54 of 1939, a supplementary decree, No. 1433 of 1940,<anchor
                        n="18" xml:id="d850-f1"/> which provided that the former Decree 1388 did not
                    necessarily contemplate the physical exchange of previously issued bonds for new
                    ones, and that any settlement which might be made under either decree required
                    the previous favorable concept of the national loan committee for its
                    validity.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Spruille Braden</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d850-f1" n="18" xml:id="d850-f1-content">
                <p>For text, see Colombia, <hi rendition="#italic">Diario Oflcial</hi>, July 25,
                    1940, p. 289.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
